:144,"givento":"USA GMW Nor'Easter","cat1":1,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":3,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":"Some discussions around rules eg \"check feet\" and on receiving fouls. Both teams could do better at bringing in their spirit captains sooner to discuss rules. "},{"game_id":143,"givento":"USA GMW Infernold","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":3,"cat4":3,"cat5":2,"total":12,"comments":"Lovely"},{"game_id":147,"givento":"CAN GMW VANS","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":3,"cat4":3,"cat5":2,"total":12,"comments":"Very well fought game. Both teams adjusted body contact for 2nd half"},{"game_id":148,"givento":"USA GMW Elderflowers","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":3,"cat5":2,"total":11,"comments":"Fantastic hucks. Fun game. "},{"game_id":142,"givento":"CAN GMW Envy","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":3,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":11,"comments":"Hard fought game. Lots of fun"},{"game_id":141,"givento":"USA GMW Molly Blue","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":3,"total":11,"comments":null},{"game_id":146,"givento":"USA GMW Henceforth","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":"We had a varied experience. They were lovely and brought back a disc that was incorrectly brought into play. They knew more about some rules and less about others. Some of our team had very positive experiences on the side line and some overheard some slightly salty comments. "},{"game_id":145,"givento":"CAN GMW Solstice","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":"Our first half was difficult (on both sides) with body contact and some heat, but both teams took a time out to recalibrate. The 2nd half was lovely. We really appreciated the spirit captains and the entire team (both sides) in making that adjustment"},{"game_id":315,"givento":"USA GMW Henceforth","cat1":2,"cat2":1,"cat3":2,"cat4":1,"cat5":3,"total":9,"comments":"Several players reported getting eye rolls in reaction to calls. Body contact that resulted in injuries. They communicated well. "},{"game_id":320,"givento":"CAN GMW Solstice","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":1,"cat5":2,"total":9,"comments":"Big reactions (verbally) to calls, not just from people involved in the play. One example overheard by our captain \"what the fuck was that call?\"\r\n\r\n2 people were noted to make several foul calls repeatedly, coming over the vertical space of our player. However we did not want this to reflect on the entire team. "}],"spiritreceived":[{"game_id":144,"givenby":"USA GMW Nor'Easter","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":3,"cat4":3,"cat5":4,"total":14,"comments":null},{"game_id":143,"givenby":"USA GMW Infernold","cat1":2,"cat2":1,"cat3":2,"cat4":3,"cat5":3,"total":11,"comments":"Appreciated the communication regarding contact at half and after the game.  Thanks!"},{"game_id":147,"givenby":"CAN GMW VANS","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":3,"cat5":3,"total":12,"comments":null},{"game_id":148,"givenby":"USA GMW Elderflowers","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":null},{"game_id":142,"givenby":"CAN GMW Envy","cat1":3,"cat2":3,"cat3":3,"cat4":3,"cat5":3,"total":15,"comments":"Efficient communication was appreciated. [score altered by spirit director, 11 to 15, per Envy request] \r\n"},{"game_id":141,"givenby":"USA GMW Molly Blue","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":3,"cat5":3,"total":12,"comments":null},{"game_id":146,"givenby":"USA GMW Henceforth","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":3,"cat4":3,"cat5":3,"total":13,"comments":"Great game "},{"game_id":145,"givenby":"CAN GMW Solstice","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":null},{"game_id":315,"givenby":"USA GMW Henceforth","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":3,"cat4":4,"cat5":3,"total":14,"comments":"They were a 4 on attitude re: de escalating contentious situations and controlling themselves"},{"game_id":320,"givenby":"CAN GMW Solstice","cat1":2,"cat2":1,"cat3":1,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":8,"comments":"Unnecessary body contact on the mark."}],"spiritstats":{"games":10},"spirittotal":{"total":119}}